            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ms Jean"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent results with minimal effort! I had some carrots that were on the way out, and this was great to salvage them. I followed some of the reviews and sliced on the diagonal ~1/4\", boiled for 2-3 min, then moved to a frying pan that had the rest of the ingredients melted in it. I continually stirred for a only a few minutes, and they got nice and coated with the glaze. Delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2017-10-01T17:09:49.513Z"
          },
          {
