            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "janmauss"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been doing this recipe for decades, probably because glazed carrots were a hit at my mother's table when I was a child. I use a bit less sugar and about 1 T of freshly grated ginger. My mom often used honey instead of brown sugar, and I'll use it in a pinch.",
