            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a favorite dish for my church’s dinners. It is easy to prepare for crowds of different sizes, using the 2x ingredient list for every two-pound bag of baby carrots. Because the instructions are so simple, preparing 12 pounds of carrots this way is easy, and comes out great.",
