            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this last night with a couple tweaks. I cut back on the sugar and butter and followed a rater's advice on letting it caramelize. I also added some toasted pecans (I toasted them in the pan I used to cook the carrots) and some chopped dates. Yummy!!!",
